  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "debug_info": {
    "intent_user": "Menampilkan progres alur dokumen penjualan dari sales quotation ke sales order lalu ke delivery order untuk setiap item/baris quotation.",
    "tables_used": ["m5_sq", "m5_sq_detail", "m5_so_detail", "m5_do_detail", "m1_item"],
    "tables_missing": [],
    "reasoning": "1) Karena user meminta progres dokumen per item quotation, tabel utama yang paling tepat adalah m5_sq_detail sebagai detail item quotation. 2) Untuk mendapatkan identitas dokumen quotation, query join ke m5_sq melalui relasi m5_sq_detail.idsq = m5_sq.sqid. 3) Untuk progres ke sales order, digunakan join_hints sales_document_flow yaitu m5_sq_detail.idsqdetail = m5_so_detail.idsqdetail. 4) Untuk progres ke delivery order, digunakan join_hints yang sama melalui m5_so_detail.idsodetail = m5_do_detail.idsodetail. Ini lebih aman dan sesuai schema dibanding mengarang join dari header. 5) Join ke m1_item dipakai untuk menampilkan kode/nama item yang lebih konsisten, dengan filter wajib m1_item.baktif = 1. 6) Filter wajib schema juga diterapkan: m5_sq.sqisclose = 0, m5_so_detail.isclose = 0, dan m5_si_detail tidak dipakai. 7) Karena satu item quotation bisa terealisasi ke banyak SO/DO, maka digunakan GROUP BY per item quotation dan agregasi COUNT(DISTINCT ...) serta SUM(...) pada kuantitas progres. 8) Kolom status progres memanfaatkan field native pada quotation detail yaitu jmlso/statusso dan menjumlahkan baris DO aktual dari relasi lanjutannya.",
    "ai_metrics": {
      "confidence_score": 0.92,
      "schema_version_used": "Semantic Query Schema OBT"
    }
  },
  "execution_context": {
    "is_syntax_valid_prediction": true,
    "linting_warnings": []
  },
  "query": "SELECT sq.sqnotransaksi AS nomor_quotation, sq.sqtgl AS tanggal_quotation, qd.idsqdetail AS id_detail_quotation, i.bkode AS kode_barang, COALESCE(i.bnama, qd.namabarang) AS nama_barang, qd.jmlbarang AS qty_quotation, qd.satuanbarang AS satuan_barang, qd.harga AS harga_quotation, qd.jmldiskon AS diskon_quotation, qd.jmlpajak1 AS pajak1_quotation, qd.jmlpajak2 AS pajak2_quotation, qd.jmlso AS qty_progres_so, qd.statusso AS status_so, COUNT(DISTINCT sod.idsodetail) AS jumlah_detail_so, COALESCE(SUM(dod.jmlbarang), 0) AS qty_progres_do, COUNT(DISTINCT dod.iddodetail) AS jumlah_detail_do, CASE WHEN COUNT(DISTINCT dod.iddodetail) > 0 THEN 'SUDAH DO' WHEN COUNT(DISTINCT sod.idsodetail) > 0 THEN 'SUDAH SO' ELSE 'BELUM SO/DO' END AS status_progres_dokumen FROM m5_sq_detail qd INNER JOIN m5_sq sq ON qd.idsq = sq.sqid LEFT JOIN m5_so_detail sod ON qd.idsqdetail = sod.idsqdetail AND sod.isclose = 0 LEFT JOIN m5_do_detail dod ON sod.idsodetail = dod.idsodetail LEFT JOIN m1_item i ON qd.idbarang = i.bid AND i.baktif = 1 WHERE sq.sqisclose = 0 GROUP BY sq.sqnotransaksi, sq.sqtgl, qd.idsqdetail, i.bkode, COALESCE(i.bnama, qd.namabarang), qd.jmlbarang, qd.satuanbarang, qd.harga, qd.jmldiskon, qd.jmlpajak1, qd.jmlpajak2, qd.jmlso, qd.statusso ORDER BY sq.sqtgl DESC, sq.sqnotransaksi DESC, qd.idsqdetail DESC",
  "error_message": null
}

